  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting women&#x2019;s organisations in Ukraine to deliver humanitarian and protection activities.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the United Nations (UN&#x2019;s) Women led Women&#x2019;s Peace and Humanitarian Fund&#x2019;s (WPHF) Ukraine Response. The WPHF supports women&#x2019;s organisations in Ukraine with rapid and flexible funding to respond to the humanitarian, protection and socio-economic recovery needs of women refugees, Internally Displaced People (IDP) women with children, and women and girls with disabilities in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
